WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.284 --> 00:00:02.154
Ek sawaal... jo linguists

2
00:00:02.174 --> 00:00:03.409
sadiyon se puchhte aa

3
00:00:03.429 --> 00:00:05.573
rahe hain. Duniya mein

4
00:00:05.593 --> 00:00:07.045
aaj lagbhag saat hazaar

5
00:00:07.065 --> 00:00:09.695
languages hain. Har language

6
00:00:09.715 --> 00:00:11.086
ke apne rules hain...

7
00:00:11.106 --> 00:00:12.760
Apne shabd... Apne sound.

